          <h3 itemprop="name">How do I set up KOReader sync with calibre 9.18's content server?</h3>
          <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
            <div itemprop="text">
              <p>In KOReader, open the sync settings and set the custom sync server to http://your-calibre-server:port/kosync, replacing the host and port with your calibre content server address. Log in with a calibre content-server user account (create one in calibre's Preferences → Sharing → Content server if you haven't). Reading positions then sync automatically across all devices and all formats of the same book — EPUB on one device, PDF on another, MOBI on a third.</p>
            </div>
