            <div itemprop="text">
              <p>OPDS 2.0 is the JSON-based successor to the original OPDS catalog protocol used by reading apps to browse remote libraries. Calibre 9.18's content server now serves OPDS 2.0 feeds natively, enabling apps like Panels, Cantook, and Thorium to browse your calibre library directly. The update also adds CBZ comic streaming with manga reading-direction support and full-text search across book contents — features unavailable in the OPDS 1.x feed.</p>
